<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $58-1/2(FIM 294.30).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $58-1/2(FIM 294.30).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $1-5/8 at $58-1/2 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 294.30 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed 5.50 markka lower at 303.50 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) was untraded in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 2.20 markka at 91.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded on Wall Street. In Helsinki on Friday, Rauma closed up one markka at 114.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
